    "## Part 3 — Model Development and Evaluation\n",
    "\n",
    "Three models representing different paradigms: **Ridge Regression** (regularised linear baseline),\n",
    "**Random Forest** (bagged trees), **HistGradientBoosting** (boosted trees). Given only ~87 training rows for\n",
    "15+ features, the tree ensembles are *expected* to fit training data better but risk overfitting, while Ridge's\n",
    "regularisation is expected to generalise more reliably."
   ]
  },
