   "source": [
    "**Critical analysis:** Ridge achieved the best and most stable validation R² (0.79) with the smallest\n",
    "train–val gap. Random Forest had the highest training R² (0.94) but the lowest validation R² (0.70) — classic\n",
    "overfitting on a small sample. HistGBM sat in between. No model underfit (all train R² > 0.9); the dominant\n",
    "failure mode is excess complexity relative to sample size. **Ridge is recommended** for its interpretability and\n",
    "generalisation, though this would likely reverse with substantially more data."
   ]
  },
